    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>小兔崽子总算出来了，7斤1两，在控制体重的不生大娃的年头，他已经算很重了</span></p><span></span><p><span>反而大王就遭了不少罪</span></p><span></span><p><span>小汉堡出来三天，转身就自己进了baby ICU</span></p><span></span><p><span>好在现在母子都健康，一切顺利。</span></p><span></span><p><span>怀孕日记系列节目完结撒花~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>生产前，慕北冷静独白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="162">02:42</a>大王&amp;小汉堡出产房，父子初见，急急忙忙赶往产后病房</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="209">03:29</a>出生第一晚，面对这残酷世界的不住咆哮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="227">03:47</a>奶爸登场，好好学习baby洗澡课</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="266">04:26</a>出门右转baby ICU</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="409">06:49</a>和大王聊聊生产过程</span></p>]]></description>
